{"seq":3,"slug":"compliance","title":"合规工程化","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/privacy-engineering/compliance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"gdpr-engineering","title":"GDPR 工程化合规","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/privacy-engineering/compliance/gdpr-engineering","wordCount":1748,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"ccpa-cpra-implementation","title":"CCPA/CPRA 工程实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/privacy-engineering/compliance/ccpa-cpra-implementation","wordCount":1675,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"privacy-impact-assessment","title":"隐私影响评估自动化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/privacy-engineering/compliance/privacy-impact-assessment","wordCount":1816,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"合规工程化\">合规工程化</h1><p>本章将法规要求翻译为可自动执行的工程控制。GDPR、CCPA/CPRA 等法规的条文看似抽象，但每一条义务都能映射为具体的技术实现——数据主体权利请求的 API 编排、处理活动记录的自动生成、隐私影响评估的流水线化。</p>\n<p>2026 年的趋势是&quot;持续合规&quot;（Continuous Compliance）：不再是年度审计前的突击准备，而是将合规检查嵌入 CI/CD 流水线，让每一次部署都自动验证隐私控制的完整性。本章三篇文档分别覆盖 GDPR 的工程化实现、CCPA/CPRA 的技术落地、以及隐私影响评估（PIA/DPIA）的自动化方法。</p>\n"}